          "type": "interest_coverage",
          "limit": 2.0,
          "unit": "x",
          "direction": "max",
          "maintenance": false,
          "text": "or less than the Closing Date Secured Net Leverage Ratio; and (iii) in the case of any Indebtedness that is not secured by a Lien on any Collateral, either: (A) the Total Net Leverage Ratio for the applicable Test Period is equal to or less than the Closing Date Total Net Leverage Ratio, or (B) the Interest Coverage Ratio for the applicable Test Period is equal to or greater than 2.00 to 1.00;"
        },
