          "type": "interest_coverage",
          "limit": 2.0,
          "unit": "x",
          "direction": "min",
          "maintenance": false,
          "text": "Secured Net Leverage Ratio; (c) with respect to any Incremental Facility or Incremental Equivalent Debt that is not secured by a Lien on any Collateral, either: (i) the Total Net Leverage Ratio for the applicable Test Period being greater than the Closing Date Total Net Leverage Ratio; or (ii) the Interest Coverage Ratio for the applicable Test Period being less than 2.00 to 1.00."
        }
